OL,3,GNEWSADozens 'ripped off' in #500,000
OL,4,Abuilding 'scam'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 30 customers claim they were
OL,7,Fscammed after paying deposits totalling
OL,8,Fnearly #500,000 for building work that
OL,9,Fwas not delivered, the BBC has learned.
OL,11,FThe BBC has heard from 13 of those
OL,12,Fcustomers who say they paid tens of
OL,13,Fthousands of pounds to South Coast
OL,14,FConstruction (Sussex) Ltd (SCC), which
OL,15,Foperated in Dorset, Hampshire, Sussex
OL,16,Fand Surrey.
OL,18,FSussex Police said it was investigating
OL,19,F"a number of reports of alleged fraud"
OL,20,Fin connection with the company.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
